<para>computes for every vertex of the mesh its closest point on the reference mesh, leaving the vertices having no projection within <ref refid="group__GeneralGroup_1ga93e080458c496f555a43b92f40f7e547" kindref="member">MeshProjectionParameters::upDistLimitSq</ref> in place; the result is expressed in the coordinates of the mesh being projected <simplesect kind="return"><para>no value if the operation was canceled by the progress callback </para>
